DATA
  rav1d_pin_66f58fa6_2026-08-29.tsv.zst — 3200 rows, the four arms above.
  Columns are gate_sweep's, with two edits to fit the repo's 30 KB budget:
  `enc_ms` dropped (timing noise, not part of any claim) and `sha256`
  truncated to a 12-char prefix — verified lossless for identity here, 1099
  distinct prefixes for 1099 distinct full hashes.
